Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 21:58:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Move a flex container's intrinsic main size into its own
 function

determine_container_main_size answers a min- or max-content probe from
a match arm: the flex-fraction sum of its items' content contributions.
Sizing a container to fit-content against definite space needs that same
min-content size from the definite-space arm, which cannot reach another
arm, so the computation moves into determine_intrinsic_main_size.

No behaviour change: the arm calls the function with the same inputs.
